    "description": "CSV Midstream develops, owns, and operates natural gas and natural gas liquids processing infrastructure in Alberta's Montney region. Its customers are upstream producers that require gas processing, compression, gathering, and related midstream services under contracted arrangements. The business follows an asset-heavy model centered on gas plants, compressor stations, and associated facilities rather than a pure marketing or advisory approach. Public materials state that CSV has grown from a single gas plant in 2019 to a network of six plants serving Grande Prairie, Grande Cache, and surrounding areas of northern Alberta. Northleaf acquired 100% of CSV in June 2019, including the Resthaven gas processing facility and Pipestone South compressor station, and has remained the company's disclosed infrastructure sponsor.",
